ion, 190+ extensions (memberships, e-commerce, analytics, Zapier), an in-CMS AI writing assistant, a ChatGPT chatbot extension, and a RAG chatbot that answers questions based on your own published content. E-commerce features include catalog management, shipping, local delivery, and no sales commission. Low-code developers can extend apps with custom HTML/CSS/JS. Plans start at ~$30/month (yearly) with a free 30-day trial and no credit card required. A white-label reseller plan is also available for agencies.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ic6u6G_eCWk/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-07T09:15:04.000Z"},{"id":"h7R8uzPkq","title":"Google AI Studio gets prompt autocomplete, design previews, and visual edit mode","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XgoMq8Sraao","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/google-ai-studio-3-0-fully-free-this-is-actually-awesome--h7r8uzpkq","summary":"Google AI Studio has received three notable updates to its vibe coding experience. First, 'Tab Tab Tab' provides prompt autocomplete to help users expand vague ideas into detailed prompts. Second, design previews let users choose from custom themes while the app is still being generated, steering visual direction early. Third, an edit mode allows direct UI component selection, annotation with a pen tool, and inline image generation/editing via Imagen (Nano Banana). Together these updates shift AI Studio from a text-only chat interface toward a visual app builder, making it more competitive with tools like Lovable and Bolt while leveraging Google's own ecosystem (Firebase, Cloud Run, Gemini APIs). The video cautions that generated apps still require code review, security checks, and cost awareness before production use.","image":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XgoMq8Sraao/sddefault.jpg","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-06T09:15:08.000Z"},{"id":"VDTGj0lQg","title":"Github's Copilot $40 PLAN IS CRAZY ($14K of USAGE!): HOW IS THIS POS